{"id": 525712, "slug": "maze-path-of-light", "name": "Maze: path of light", "name_original": "Maze: path of light", "description": "<p>Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths—experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p>Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h3>Features:</h3><p>- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types—square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p>- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p>- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p>- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p>- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p>- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p>Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2020-07-07", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-04T11:39:32", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e2e/e2e4c7fbb8417848841cbb6bab20fc08_uPw4VOU.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e61/e61bcd2b85a3c71094c830913dafd206_cFuEeUJ.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 10, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_cou